# Finance Digest, environment variables (example).
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your keys so the News, Stocks, and
# FinAI features work with zero setup for end users.
#
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#   # then edit .env.local and paste your key after the equals sign
#
# Get a free key (no credit card) at https://console.groq.com/keys
#
# NOTE: EXPO_PUBLIC_ variables are embedded in the app bundle at build time and
# are readable by anyone who downloads the app. This is fine for a demo or the
# Congressional App Challenge; restrict or rotate the key if it is ever abused.
# For a production app where the key must stay secret, use a serverless proxy
# instead of embedding it.

EXPO_PUBLIC_GROQ_API_KEY=

# Optional: Perigon news API (https://www.goperigon.com). Leave blank to use the
# free RSS feeds only.
EXPO_PUBLIC_PERIGON_API_KEY=
